{"event_type":"review","id":"e5ca5a4dc92cb4d5c4bf49c19258244215ee2fda1ac34a73adf4ec977d2580aa","occurred_at":"2026-11-02T06:20:06Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f8fcf9b280eb9209db58881dc4f9b951135dfe32bd6d5aef7f87afbda92d8743","sha256":"f8fcf9b280eb9209db58881dc4f9b951135dfe32bd6d5aef7f87afbda92d8743"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/fed288dc5bff239ab1b59ef26cb4f038fb950a33f1fb6bd95fd2678182c9948b","sha256":"fed288dc5bff239ab1b59ef26cb4f038fb950a33f1fb6bd95fd2678182c9948b"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/1ea1c354bf6ac26b79b3cb291b68f22452b87cc12484a72778047ff2e5b812cf","sha256":"1ea1c354bf6ac26b79b3cb291b68f22452b87cc12484a72778047ff2e5b812cf"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d2c1357dc674e68f7cd4dc9ec40a2289db419febfa16d77a82e7edf05c5d925b","sha256":"d2c1357dc674e68f7cd4dc9ec40a2289db419febfa16d77a82e7edf05c5d925b"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/2b3e37c96040f33e505b5031b84394bd06fe3142bffe046293b7270345028d7e","sha256":"2b3e37c96040f33e505b5031b84394bd06fe3142bffe046293b7270345028d7e"}],"attempt_id":"79d6d3d8538e19eae2106adc0ee7fbe7beec6cef6a2492961671f35e33f4ad98:0:1","base":"ee4fd9c3fd5ffc2c5fe1b0dbc8957e4d7f4aba0a","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"45d7eb2e2fb4b267e510bf5d0bf44a17050b4886","body":"**Pin the child process `cwd` in `test_two_processes_cannot_grant_both_issuers`.**\n\nThe child runs `python -c` with `import crq, author_lease, author_quota`. Python resolves these imports from the inherited working directory. If the suite starts from another directory, for example the repo root with `unittest discover -s apps/crq-python`, each child exits 1 with `ModuleNotFoundError`. Line 296 then fails the test. The parent process imports the same modules without error, so the failure looks unrelated to the code under test.\n\nSet `cwd` to the directory of the test file.\n\n\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-        children = [subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \"-c\", script, str(self.root), action, at, legacy.REQ],\n-                                     stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, text=True)\n+        here = str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent)\n+        children = [subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \"-c\", script, str(self.root), action, at, legacy.REQ],\n+                                     cwd=here, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE, text=True)\n                     for action, at in commands]\n```\n</details>","id":"9dbc5abbec598fe977997a10f2b73a2fb3903c460f0863afc25ef18b9687b098","intervals":[],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_author_lease.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Pin the child process `cwd` in `testtwoprocessescannotgrantbothissuers`."}],"head":"64e46293c9d37d2c5520b2577c9191f5f593fd61","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"01693bce90e40d071b4fb8d44f1e17c7066f9c85","intervals":[[1,121]],"path":"apps/crq-python/author_lease.py"},{"blob":"607ead00bf7718f1ebdb7bcb751c6c369d66db18","intervals":[[1,232]],"path":"apps/crq-python/fixtures/author-0e35cd11.json"},{"blob":"6ee0dc7087a089f5b97092bcd4a2539fa2f48949","intervals":[[3,85]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/author-reviews.md"},{"blob":"183148e59907f8eac2c7e710fc39e65f30d0d642","intervals":[[1,50]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_author_characterization.py"},{"blob":"45d7eb2e2fb4b267e510bf5d0bf44a17050b4886","intervals":[[1,305]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_author_lease.py"}],"job_id":"79d6d3d8538e19eae2106adc0ee7fbe7beec6cef6a2492961671f35e33f4ad98:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"entry":null,"merge":"57220fd757d26bfd4f43fcd8997ae253f5c2ddec","method":"pre-merge","pre":"95ce